/ActualText (Senior Product Designer with 12 years of experience in fintech and consumer apps. I care as much about how a product works underneath as how it looks on screen. The systems, the handoff, the decisions that affect the whole team and not just one feature. I work best when I can go deep, stay close to engineering, and build things that hold up over time. Currently based in Norrk\366ping, Sweden, available for roles across Europe or remotely.)
